FlashAttention-derived attention helpers
---------------------------------------
Source: https://github.com/Dao-AILab/flash-attention

xattn includes modified FlashAttention attention kernels and helpers in
csrc/attention, together with supporting CUDA and Hopper utilities. These
components support the FlashSCA, FlashSWA, and SoftDelta SM90 implementations
and are compiled into xattn_cuda.

Local files retain their individual copyright notices. The FlashAttention-derived
code is covered by the BSD 3-Clause license reproduced below. This attribution
notice is maintained by xattn for its adapted copy.

